              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, the case concerns Congress\u2019s enactment of 28 U.S.C. \u00a71367, which was intended to provide a federal forum for plaintiffs while respecting state interests through a mechanism to return cases to state court."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Lindemann",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "74f75e6d7dbe31d69121ac5609c55f84728c284c43323567a1fb8e9790b336ba",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-74f75e6d7dbe-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Lindemann, the respondent argues that \u00a71367(d) intrudes on principles of state sovereignty."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Overview",
