                "start": 3
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioner, petitioner asserts that \u00a71367 was enacted to give plaintiffs a choice of a federal forum while preserving comity and federalism by allowing cases to be remanded to state court."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Petitioner Position",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
