              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 19,
                "start": 19
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Lindemann, respondent contends that \u00a71367(d) intrudes on state sovereignty."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Lindemann",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "74f75e6d7dbe31d69121ac5609c55f84728c284c43323567a1fb8e9790b336ba",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-74f75e6d7dbe-0001-0005"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 34,
                "start": 34
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Lindemann, respondent argues that there is no substantial federal interest justifying the stay in this case."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Lindemann",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "74f75e6d7dbe31d69121ac5609c55f84728c284c43323567a1fb8e9790b336ba",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-74f75e6d7dbe-0001-0002"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 22,
                "start": 22
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Lindemann, respondent distinguishes the Soldiers\u2019 and Sailors\u2019 Civil Relief Act context, noting a major difference when a stay is involved."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Lindemann",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "74f75e6d7dbe31d69121ac5609c55f84728c284c43323567a1fb8e9790b336ba",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-74f75e6d7dbe-0002-0000"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 36,
                "start": 36
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Lindemann, respondent states that the municipality has standing under the Tenth Amendment, not the Eleventh Amendment, referencing Printz v. United States."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Lindemann",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "74f75e6d7dbe31d69121ac5609c55f84728c284c43323567a1fb8e9790b336ba",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-74f75e6d7dbe-0002-0002"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 43,
                "start": 43
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Lindemann, respondent emphasizes the significance of the state law interest under the Tenth Amendment, arguing that Eleventh Amendment jurisprudence does not govern this case."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Peck",
          "citations": [
